ext":"."}],"title":"init(timeRelation:timeSignature:symbol:separator:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLInterchangeable\/init(timeRelation:timeSignature:symbol:separator:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLInterchangeable":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The interchangeable type is used to represent the second in a pair of interchangeable dual time signatures,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the 6\/8 in 3\/4 (6\/8). A separate symbol attribute value is available compared to the time element’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbol attribute, which applies to the first of the dual time signatures."}],"title":"MXLInterchangeable","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlinterchangeable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLInterchangeable","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLInterchangeable","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLInterchangeable","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTimeSymbol":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLTimeSymbol","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLTimeSymbol","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The time-symbol type indicates how to display a time signature. The normal value is the usual fractional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"display, and is the implied symbol type if none is specified. Other options are the common and cut time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbols, as well as a single number with an implied denominator. The note symbol indicates that the beat-type"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"should be represented with the corresponding downstem note rather than a number. The dotted-note symbol"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"indicates that the beat-type should be represented with a dotted downstem note that corresponds to three times"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the beat-type value, and a numerator that is one third the beats value.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTimeSymbol","title":"MXLTimeSymbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltimesymbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTimeSignature":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTimeSignature"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTimeSignature"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltimesignature","role":"symbol","title":"MXLTimeSignature","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTimeSignature","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Time signatures are represented by the beats element for the numerator and the beat-type element for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"denominator.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTimeSeparator":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The time-separator type indicates how to display the arrangement between the beats and beat-type values in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time signature. The default value is none. The horizontal, diagonal, and vertical values represent horizontal,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"diagonal lower-left to upper-right, and vertical lines respectively. For these values, the beats and beat-type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values are arranged on either side of the separator line. The none value represents no separator with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"beats and beat-type arranged vertically. The adjacent value represents no separator with the beats and beat-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type arranged horizontally."}],"title":"MXLTimeSeparator","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltimeseparator","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTimeSeparator","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLTimeSeparator","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLTimeSeparator","kind":"identifier"}]}}}